       - AccShortName: disabled input (read-only — backend PUT only updates Csg7Group)
       - AccountDescription: disabled input (backend does not expose description edit)
       - Csg7Group: asp-items select bound to ViewBag.Csg7GroupList (populated by controller)
       - Hidden input hdnAccShortName carries AccShortName for saveAccountCategory() AJAX call
       - @@Html.AntiForgeryToken() included for security compliance
       - Modal header title always "Edit Account Category" (no Add mode — AllowAdd=false)
       - Save button calls saveAccountCategory() defined in Index.cshtml @@section Scripts
     PRESERVED:
       - Field IDs from HTML prototype: modal-acccat-shortname, modal-acccat-description,
         modal-acccat-csg7group
       - Form group IDs: fg-acccat-shortname, fg-acccat-description, fg-acccat-csg7group
       - Error message element IDs preserved for potential JS error display
       - Mandatory fields note (* Mandatory fields)
       - Cancel / Update button layout matching HTML prototype
       - maint-dlg-* CSS class names from HTML prototype modal structure
     DEFERRED / REQUIRES HUMAN REVIEW:
